     "email": "dajac@apache.org",
     "date": "2026-10-28T17:34:50Z"
    },
    "message": "KAFKA-21214: Start the new map of a member at the default capacity (follow-up)\n\nA member that owns no partitions gets its new map from\n`Utils.newHashMap(0)` in `AssignmentBuilder.ownedPartitions`. Its table\nstarts with a single slot and resizes at 1, 2, 4 and 7 entries before\nreaching the default capacity of 16. This patch sizes the map for at\nleast 12 entries, which a map of the default capacity holds without\nresizing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
